938op7hXdh5ukA-neUwqI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR4y31GkNJ02AkIeKCwemHsEkMl-LURIhF5Sn8AX_sFAw&oe=6B0055C1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "666231228954240", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75443236_666231232287573_5739604952955842655_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iVoYJ670eowQ7kNvwFJyRhi&_nc_oc=Ado72Joi4WrZJQD_Ga1LdcgX_jdsUSEt9i5YAgtLg4m3gwVaGrqI7QFoJvRkrgG8O-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQmDwFVNj1POuFnjar8Qd5A8M2-rmZjvyrIDuMx6bHr7w&oe=6B008053"}, "display_name": "Hammer Heads", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Hammer Heads is a FUN & CRAZY multiplayer game. \ud83d\udd28\ud83e\udd2f\nRace, Escape, Defend, Battle Royale, Co-Op with / or against friends or random players online.\n\nWalk, Jog or Run around as a human using hand movements but NOT USING JOYSTICKS\nNEW - You move forward in direction of your body not HEAD and your head is free to look around.\n\nYou got hammers in a game for more fun. \ud83d\udd28\n\nIn first version you play Maze Out. \nTry to exit from a compact maze full of monsters. Use hammers to hit monsters and other players. \nLoot Hoins from air drops or other players. \n\nFind a key and exit the maze to earn rewards. This maze out is chaotic with your friends. ", "short_description": "Hammer Heads is a FUN & CRAZY multiplayer game. \nRace, Escape, Defend, Battle Royale, Co-Op with / or against friends or random players online.\n\nWalk, Jog or Run around as a human using hand movements but NOT USING JOYSTICKS\nNEW - You move forward in direction of your body not HEAD and your head is free to look around\n\nYou got hammers in a game for more fun. \n\nIn first version you play Maze Out. You try to find key while running from monster. This maze out is chaotic with your friends. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_